    "            extc_rc_worstKind, extc_rc_worstWhy, extc_rc_worstBudget, extc_rc_worstNs / 1000.0,\n",
    "            extc_rc_worstPops, extc_rc_worstMarked, extc_rc_worstWords, extc_rc_worstSeg, extc_rc_worstPushes,\n",
    "            extc_rc_worstSwWords, extc_rc_worstSwFreed, EXTC_RC_SCAN_CHUNK);\n",
